        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="l2wsSnraBKrME0LePlul-46" value="this class instantiates Sprite(&#39;ScrollableContainer&#39;+_Object.incrementId());, Sprite(&#39;EmulatedStage&#39;+_Object.incrementId());&#xa; Sprite(&#39;BackStage&#39;+_Object.incrementId());&#xa;It is also responsible for:&#xa;Dragging or dropping the stage or a component&#xa;Selecting components&#xa;Activating rules&#xa;Communicating the selected component to the PropertyInspector form.&#xa;Among other things.&#xa;Everything is in the testing phase and the code can change logic or location at any time.&#xa;" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=0;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=#f8cecc;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;collapsible=0;container=0;overflow=visible;fixedWidth=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="l2wsSnraBKrME0LePlul-45" vertex="1">
