        <mxCell id="l2wsSnraBKrME0LePlul-53" value="backStage is the EmulatedStage container, it is responsible for listening to events within itself and the EmulatedStage to know, for example, which component is selected or not. It must be sized depending on the size of EmulatedStage to allow, through scrolls, the complete displacement of the entire stage when it is larger than its parent container StageEditorSPT." style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=0;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=#f8cecc;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;collapsible=0;container=0;overflow=visible;fixedWidth=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="l2wsSnraBKrME0LePlul-50" vertex="1">
